  "title": "Bow Ties with Sausage, Tomatoes, and Cream",
  "description": "A tasty creamy sausage pasta dish. Sweet Italian sausage is simmered with tomato, garlic, onion, and cream for a rich sauce served over bow tie pasta.",
  "authors": [
