        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pP3WWNn74f-eLRj_x8Q4NWHv8qk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/26257-BowTiesWithSausageTomatoesAndCream-MFS-Step2-0260-ed797453c733426db8c41679b93e186d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/26257/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in tomatoes, cream, and salt. Simmer until mixture thickens, 8 to 10 minutes.",
